{"version":1,"content":"<p>【流料 ⚠️】針對近期市場盛傳 NVIDIA 停產 GeForce RTX 5090 的傳聞，NVIDIA 官方已正式出面澄清。</p><p>NVIDIA 個人運算業務資深副總裁 Jeff Fisher 日前公開表示，雖然受供應鏈緊縮影響導致當前市場供應有限，但該款旗艦產品「絕對沒有停產」，只是暫時缺貨而已，公司未來仍會出貨 RTX 5090 以滿足消費市場需求。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:00:40.828518+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T19:57:40.948899+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:15.671245+00:00","content_hash":"12f9bb79321e2cdb95a12e86fffdff024e6a18a1c6d6680867266aadd411a9a1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}